{
  "about": "The dock's application menu (docs/adr/0034-the-dock.mdx), as a Mac's Dock: Allo (sample/EditingProbe.tsx) with the shell and the development registry (Stash, Atlas and Inbox kept in the dock). The pointer over Inbox's icon shows its name above it, Bloom's tooltip in a popup of the platform's (the dock's strip would clip it), gone as the pointer leaves and hidden by a press until the pointer comes back. Inbox started from the dock; a long press on its icon opens its menu above it, Bloom's context menu in the platform's popup, named by the application and announced as a menu: its window checked, Show All Windows, Hide, Options and Quit; the tooltip is gone while it is open; Escape closes it; the pointer back over the icon, a secondary click opens the same menu, the name going; Down, End and Return choose Quit from the keyboard: Inbox is asked to close, its process ends and its running mark goes. A Control-click on Inbox, not running now, opens its Open and Options and launches nothing.",
  "module": "EditingProbe",
  "window": [
    600,
    360
  ],
  "shell": "OxyOSShell",
  "app": {
    "id": "so.oxy.allo",
    "title": "Allo"
  },
  "steps": [
